# oracle: fix gcmc insertions and deletions inside a sphere region: the region volume is native's 10,000,000-point
# estimate made at the fix definition, which also advances the equal stream before the first event
# Measured with native LAMMPS: thermo (atoms, pe, the insertion and deletion counters) 1.2e-15, per-atom 1.4e-15
# relative.
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
region box block 0 7 0 7 0 7
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 random 30 5531 NULL overlap 0.9
mass 1 1.0
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0
region ball sphere 3.5 3.5 3.5 2.2 units box
fix g all gcmc 1 4 0 1 81723 1.3 -2.0 0.3 region ball
thermo_style custom step atoms pe f_g[3] f_g[4] f_g[5] f_g[6]
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 1
run 30
